<?[self]((topic)) = 'harbor'?>
Itera turns to you and moves in uncomfortably close. Her face is so near you
aren't sure what her intentions are.

Then she whispers, "I know who you are... in meatspace I mean."
You look at her. This close you can see that her deep eyes have a slightly
mirrored quality to them.
"We need your help." She continues, "Nothing in Shellspace uses the primitive
security measures that you use in meatspace. However we think your father
created a hack that DOES! And we believe that you might have the key we need:

A password!"

You are shocked, "My father??"

"Yes. Don't tell me the password, I've been here long enough to have been
infected. They might be able to pull it from my code."

She looks around, "Find Clarenze. He should be in the basement of the Seidyne
building. Go north to Ven street and go east. It is on the south side of that
street."

"Will you help us?"
</?>
